theme = SubResource("Theme_xil8a")
text = "Morning Breeze: (Joy-Gin-Vodka)
A refreshing tonic that boosts your mood after a long day of contributing
work. For any worker that believes in improving their current situation.

HeartMender:(Grief-Vodka-Tequila)
For those with broken heart that can’t heal them on their own. Only
through inner calm can one become productive again.

Forget-Me-Shot:(Grief-Gin)
When you really need to forget something that hinders you to contribute
to our Great Friend. Drink with extreme caution.

Lions’ Heart:(Rage-Vodka-Vodka)
For any brave soul that needs to become stronger to survive the trials of
our great Nation.

Brick Wall:(Vodka-Gin-Tequila)
Sometimes you just need to numb yourself to everything. Always good when
doing it for your Friends.

Best Friends Forever:(Joy-Gin-Tequila)
For when someone is a bad Friend. Only serve in worst-case scenarios.

Serenity:(Joy-Grief-Rage)
Own recipe: Use when the illusion is broken."
fit_content = true

